<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>items</key>
    <array>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>Photos 增强</string>
            <key>footerText</key>
            <string>控制本插件的全部功能。关闭后，图库界面增强、最近项目排序、免确认删除及 CR3 App 兼容均停止工作。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <true/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>ayao.photosrecentssort</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>enabled</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>总开关</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>ayao.photosrecentssort/preferences.changed</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>footerText</key>
            <string>隐藏照片 App 中与缩放层级相关的控件，并压缩对应工具栏高度，让图库界面更简洁。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <true/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>ayao.photosrecentssort</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>galleryCleanEnabled</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>图库清爽模式</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>ayao.photosrecentssort/preferences.changed</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>footerText</key>
            <string>仅调整照片 App“最近项目”的显示顺序，按拍摄时间及同批次信息稳定排序；不会修改照片文件或照片数据库。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <false/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>ayao.photosrecentssort</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>recentsTimeSortEnabled</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>最近项目时间排序</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>ayao.photosrecentssort/preferences.changed</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>footerText</key>
            <string>删除照片时跳过系统确认步骤。开启后误触会直接执行删除，请谨慎使用。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <false/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>ayao.photosrecentssort</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>skipDeleteConfirmationEnabled</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>删除无需确认</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>ayao.photosrecentssort/preferences.changed</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>footerText</key>
            <string>照片 App、抖音和 Lightroom 的选图界面使用 CR3 内嵌 JPEG 显示预览；抖音和 Lightroom 选择后仍读取原始 CR3。微信选择后使用最高分辨率内嵌 JPEG，避免朋友圈提示“未能添加”。不会创建或删除相册照片；照片 App 最密集网格仍可能显示白框，以保证滚动流畅。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <true/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>ayao.photosrecentssort</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>cr3PreviewEnabled</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>CR3 App 预览兼容</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>ayao.photosrecentssort/preferences.changed</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>action</key>
            <string>respringTapped</string>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSButtonCell</string>
            <key>isDestructive</key>
            <true/>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>重启桌面</string>
        </dict>
    </array>
    <key>title</key>
    <string>Photos 增强</string>
</dict>
</plist>
